<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan auctions six-month bonds in OMO.</title>
<headline>Pakistan auctions six-month bonds in OMO.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Thursday it had auctioned six-month maturity short term federal bonds worth a total of 1.8 billion rupees in its weekly open market operation (OMO) held on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			 Offered	  Accepted	  Max. cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sale	8,165	    1,300	     16.95 pct</p>
<p>Three-month	    200		nil		     nil</p>
<p>Five-month	   1,500		500	     16.95 pct</p>
<p>Total (million rupees) 9,865	    1,800</p>
<p>($1 = 40.49 rupees) -- Ovais Subhani 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
